NC Digital provides local SEO for Aberdare and Cynon Valley businesses. We help you rank higher on Google, show up in the map results, and turn local searches into calls and enquiries.

We are based just over the mountain in Merthyr Tydfil, so we know the valleys and how people here look for local businesses. Need a website to support your SEO? See our [Aberdare web design service](/web-design-aberdare/).

## Why local SEO matters in Aberdare

In the Cynon Valley, most people still find a local business by searching Google on their phone. Searches like "plumber Aberdare" or "hairdresser Mountain Ash" show three map results first, and those three businesses get most of the calls.

Plenty of valleys businesses still rely on word of mouth and Facebook. That makes it easier for a business that takes Google seriously to stand out quickly.

## What our Aberdare SEO service includes

- **Local keyword research:** the searches people use in Aberdare, Mountain Ash, Hirwaun and Abercynon
- **Google Business Profile optimisation:** services, photos, posts and a simple way to collect more reviews
- **Service and area pages:** clear pages that match what you do and where you work
- **On-page and technical fixes:** titles, speed, mobile layout and indexing
- **Local citations and links:** consistent listings and relevant local links
- **Monthly reporting:** calls, enquiries and rankings, explained in plain English

## Proof it works in the valleys

[IR Energy](/blog/ir-energy-seo-case-study/), a renewable energy installer based in Merthyr Tydfil, went from two or three website enquiries a month to around 20–30 after a new homepage and an ongoing SEO campaign with us.

## What it costs

Local SEO starts from **£200 a month**, with a minimum of three months. Most businesses see meaningful movement within three to six months.

